# Default set vocabulary: words, not numbers.
#
# Copied to <home>/config/sets.rec on first use; edit that copy and add codes as you
# need them. Each entry has a Code (2-8 capital letters or digits, used in disc
# ids such as TRIP-01_201907_Q) and any number of Parent codes, so the
# vocabulary is a directed acyclic graph (a polyhierarchy, like SKOS
# "broader"): SCAN sits under both RECORDS and PHOTO. Entries without a Parent
# are top-level groups. Order (optional) sorts siblings for display.
#
# A disc has one Set (its id prefix and numbering) and any number of extra
# Category codes; it records every vocabulary path of both (Path fields), so
# the disc stays understandable without this file. Never reuse a code for a
# different meaning: add a new one instead.
#
# Optional fields:
#   Alias      other words for it (repeatable). `--set holidays` and a folder
#              named "Holidays" both resolve to TRIP. For folder names an alias
#              beats a code, so "Projects" means PROJ, not the PROJECTS group.
#   ScopeNote  what belongs here and what goes elsewhere.
#   Match      file or folder name glob (repeatable) that suggests this code
#              when `arv make` sees such files: "*.kicad_pcb", "*.git".
#              A pattern with "/" is matched against the whole path.

%rec: Set
%key: Code
%mandatory: Code Name
%type: Order int
%allowed: Code Name Description Parent Order Alias ScopeNote Match

Code: MEMORIES
Name: Memories
Description: personal photos, video and audio
Order: 1

Code: PHOTO
Name: Photos
Description: photographs from cameras and phones
Parent: MEMORIES
Alias: pictures
Alias: pics
Alias: camera
Match: *.jpg
Match: *.jpeg
Match: *.heic
Match: *.dng
Match: *.cr2
Match: *.nef
Match: *.arw
ScopeNote: photos that are not from a trip or event; scans of prints go in SCAN

Code: TRIP
Name: Trips and holidays
Description: photos and video from travel
Parent: PHOTO
Alias: holiday
Alias: holidays
Alias: travel
Alias: vacation

Code: FAMILY
Name: Family
Description: family life, children, relatives
Parent: PHOTO

Code: EVENT
Name: Events
Description: weddings, birthdays, celebrations, gatherings
Parent: PHOTO
Alias: wedding
Alias: birthday
Alias: party

Code: VIDEO
Name: Home video
Description: video recordings and home movies
Parent: MEMORIES
Alias: videos
Alias: movies
Alias: footage
Match: *.mp4
Match: *.mov
Match: *.mts
Match: *.m2ts
ScopeNote: your own recordings; bought or downloaded films go in MEDIA

Code: AUDIO
Name: Audio recordings
Description: voice memos, recordings, own music
Parent: MEMORIES
Alias: recordings
Alias: voice
Match: *.wav
Match: *.m4a

Code: RECORDS
Name: Records
Description: documents and paperwork
Order: 2
Alias: documents
Alias: paperwork
Alias: docs

Code: SCAN
Name: Scans
Description: scanned paper documents and photo prints
Parent: RECORDS
Parent: PHOTO
Alias: scanned
Alias: scanner

Code: LETTERS
Name: Letters and correspondence
Description: letters, cards, email printouts
Parent: RECORDS
Alias: correspondence
Alias: mail

Code: LEGAL
Name: Legal and identity
Description: contracts, certificates, passports, wills, deeds
Parent: RECORDS
Alias: identity
Alias: contracts
Alias: certificates

Code: TAXES
Name: Taxes
Description: tax returns and supporting documents
Parent: FINANCE
Alias: tax
Alias: taxreturn

Code: FINANCE
Name: Finance
Description: bank statements, invoices, insurance, payslips
Parent: RECORDS
Alias: bank
Alias: banking
Alias: invoices
Alias: receipts
Alias: money

Code: HEALTH
Name: Health
Description: medical records, prescriptions, test results
Parent: RECORDS
Alias: medical

Code: HOME
Name: Home and property
Description: house, renovations, manuals, warranties
Parent: RECORDS
Alias: house
Alias: property

Code: CAREER
Name: Work and study
Order: 3

Code: WORK
Name: Work
Description: job and career material
Parent: CAREER
Alias: job
Alias: career

Code: SCHOOL
Name: School and study
Description: courses, notes, theses
Parent: CAREER
Alias: study
Alias: university
Alias: uni
Alias: college

Code: PROJECTS
Name: Projects
Description: things you made
Order: 4

Code: PROJ
Name: Personal projects
Description: a project's files of every kind together (code, designs, notes, photos)
Parent: PROJECTS
Alias: projects
Alias: project
ScopeNote: one project with all its kinds of files; add CODE, ELEC or DESIGN as Categories

Code: CODE
Name: Software
Description: source code and programming projects
Parent: PROJECTS
Alias: software
Alias: source
Alias: src
Alias: repos
Alias: programming
Match: *.git
Match: *.py
Match: *.c
Match: *.h
Match: *.cpp
Match: *.rs
Match: *.go
Match: *.js
Match: *.ts
Match: *.java
Match: Makefile
Match: CMakeLists.txt
Match: Cargo.toml
Match: package.json

Code: ELEC
Name: Electronics
Description: circuits, PCBs, firmware, hardware projects
Parent: PROJECTS
Alias: electronics
Alias: hardware
Alias: pcb
Alias: firmware
Match: *.kicad_pcb
Match: *.kicad_sch
Match: *.sch
Match: *.brd
Match: *.gbr
Match: *.ino

Code: DESIGN
Name: Design and art
Description: drawings, CAD, 3D printing, graphics
Parent: PROJECTS
Alias: art
Alias: cad
Alias: drawings
Alias: graphics
Match: *.stl
Match: *.step
Match: *.stp
Match: *.scad
Match: *.f3d
Match: *.blend
Match: *.svg
Match: *.psd
Match: *.xcf
Match: *.kra

Code: WRITING
Name: Writing
Description: articles, stories, blogs, books
Parent: PROJECTS
Alias: blog
Alias: articles
Alias: stories

Code: COLLECT
Name: Collections
Description: things you gathered rather than made
Order: 5

Code: BOOKS
Name: Books and papers
Description: e-books, articles, reference material
Parent: COLLECT
Alias: ebooks
Alias: papers
Alias: library
Match: *.epub
Match: *.mobi
Match: *.azw3
Match: *.djvu

Code: MEDIA
Name: Media library
Description: films, music albums, podcasts
Parent: COLLECT
Alias: music
Alias: films
Alias: podcasts
Match: *.flac
Match: *.mkv

Code: GAMES
Name: Games
Description: games, saves, mods
Parent: COLLECT
Alias: saves
Alias: roms
Alias: mods

Code: BACKUPS
Name: Backups and exports
Order: 6
Alias: backup
Alias: exports

Code: SYSTEM
Name: System backups
Description: computer backups and disk images
Parent: BACKUPS
Alias: disk images
Alias: os
Match: *.img
Match: *.vhd
Match: *.vhdx
Match: *.vmdk
Match: *.qcow2

Code: PHONE
Name: Phone backups
Description: phone backups and exports
Parent: BACKUPS
Alias: mobile
Alias: android
Alias: iphone
Alias: whatsapp

Code: EMAIL
Name: Email and messages
Description: mailbox exports, chat exports
Parent: BACKUPS
Alias: emails
Alias: inbox
Match: *.mbox
Match: *.eml
Match: *.pst

Code: WEB
Name: Web archives
Description: saved websites (WARC), social media exports
Parent: BACKUPS
Alias: websites
Alias: social
Match: *.warc
Match: *.warc.gz

Code: MISC
Name: Miscellaneous
Description: material that fits nowhere else yet
Order: 9
Alias: other
Alias: stuff